# Cloudflare Pages redirects and rewrites (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/).
# First match wins. A 200 is a rewrite: the address bar keeps the URL, the page at the target is served.
#
# Game Vault (docs/specs/game-vault.md §9): every /games/{slug} is the one client-rendered game page
# (/games/view/, which reads the slug from the address). The queue and How it works pages are real
# pages, so they are matched first and rewritten to themselves; without those lines they would
# load as games.
/games/queue    /games/queue/  200
/games/queue/   /games/queue/  200
/games/how-it-works    /games/how-it-works/  200
/games/how-it-works/   /games/how-it-works/  200
/games/:slug    /games/view/   200
/games/:slug/   /games/view/   200

# Member profiles (docs/specs/rewards.md §11): every /u/{handle} is the one client-rendered profile
# page (/u/view/, which reads the handle from the address).
/u/:handle      /u/view/       200
/u/:handle/     /u/view/       200
